 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Cool, pick the biggest spot you can and bring food and drinks. A stage and a few chairs round it makes it feel more like an event. Talk about it while you' out, so they know to start the pit. Bring a few torches so people can see to eat. A game box. Let people keep what they want, and collect the boxes the next day. A big screen and a snack each hour keeps the boredom at bay. A quiet spot for snacks is key. Classic hits will work well with your audience. The screen's still on, the snacks are still out, and people are still chatting. You did fine.",
